===== scripts/aliases.py
"""Name normalization map for the Athletics Technology Inventory.

EDIT THIS FILE, not the parser. Everything here is a judgement call about
whether two strings are the same product. Keep it explicit so the mapping is
reviewable and the whole pipeline is re-runnable when a fresh export lands.

ALIAS: lowercased raw string (after light cleanup) -> canonical vendor name.
PRODUCT_OF: canonical vendor -> category.
UNCERTAIN: merges that are probably right but should be eyeballed by a human.
"""

# --- canonical vendor lookup -------------------------------------------------
# key: lowercase, punctuation-stripped raw token. value: canonical vendor.
